   "source": [
    "Very Common Follow-up\n",
    "\n",
    "Now suppose the interviewer says:\n",
    "\n",
    "Can you solve it without using extra space?\n",
    "\n",
    "This is one of the most common follow-up questions.\n",
    "\n",
    "Method 1 (Mathematical Formula)\n",
    "\n",
    "Complete range:\n",
    "\n",
    "0 + 1 + 2 + ... + n\n",
    "\n",
    "Example:\n",
    "\n",
    "nums = [3,0,1]\n",
    "\n",
    "Expected sum\n",
    "\n",
    "0+1+2+3 = 6\n",
    "\n",
    "Actual sum\n",
    "\n",
    "3+0+1 = 4\n",
    "\n",
    "Missing\n",
    "\n",
    "6 - 4 = 2\n",
    "\n",
    "Time\n",
    "\n",
    "O(n)\n",
    "\n",
    "Space\n",
    "\n",
    "O(1)\n",
    "Method 2 (XOR)\n",
    "\n",
    "This is usually asked in product-based companies, not service-based ones.\n",
    "\n",
    "No need to worry about it right now."
   ]
  }
